gamemanager (2.4.5) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add IGDB database dump tool with stop/resume functionality
  * Create standalone IGDB dump script in tools/igdb/dump.py
  * Add comprehensive stop/resume functionality with progress tracking
  * Support for dumping entire IGDB database (games, platforms, genres, etc.)
  * Rate limiting and batch processing for large datasets
  * Progress management utility for checking and clearing progress
  * Complete documentation and examples
  * Independent of main application code
  * Fix frontend multiple IGDB search requests issue
  * Add request progress tracking to prevent simultaneous requests
  * Implement button click protection with event prevention
  * Add proper cleanup with finally block to reset request flag
  * Remove aggressive backend rate limiting (root cause was frontend)
  * Add debug logging to track request lifecycle
  * Prevent rapid clicking and duplicate API calls

gamemanager (2.3.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix mediatype files deployment to match platforms.json behavior
  * Always copy mediatype files to var/db (same as platforms.json)
  * Remove conditional copying that was preventing proper volume mount support
  * Ensure mediatype files are always available in persistent volume

gamemanager (2.3.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Werkzeug production error by adding allow_unsafe_werkzeug=True
  * Resolve 'Werkzeug web server is not designed to run in production' error

